            0.452
          ],
          "content": "**Q. In each of these cases, observe**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.453,
            0.602,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "**i. how the length XY compares to that of AB and**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.471,
            0.53,
            0.487
          ],
          "content": "**ii. the shape of the 4-sided figure ABYX.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.488,
            0.323,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** i. XY = AB"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.506,
            0.414,
            0.524
          ],
          "content": "ii. ABYX is a rectangle"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
