        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.541,
            0.874,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": "**Q. How does the farthest distance between X and Y compare with the length of AC? BD?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.578,
            0.66,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "Ans. The farthest distance between X and Y is equal to AC or BD."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.614,
            0.211,
            0.63
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Construct"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.631,
            0.845,
            0.666
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Construct a rectangle that can be divided into 3 identical squares as shown in the figure.**"
