        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.667,
            0.658,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Hint: Take the length of the rectangle three times its breadth."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
